WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:04.620
This is WaveQA, AI mobile test
automation for your desktop.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.600
Create a project, choose
Android, and add your app.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.840
Click Connect. WaveQA starts its own Android
emulator and installs your app for you.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:26.130
Your app runs live. Tap, swipe,
and type right inside WaveQA.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.970
Then create a folder for your captures.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.530
Now, capture each screen of
the flow you want to test.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:35.730
First, here we log in, then capture
the home, list, and form screens.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.520
Each capture keeps a
screenshot and a screen layout.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.480
Add your AI provider key once in settings.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:58.960
It's stored encrypted.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.050
Click Generate and pick a preset.

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:15.460
Here, happy path. The AI writes tests from

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:15.980
your captures.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:28.830
It also proposes reusable setup flows,
like logging in, review them, then

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:34.490
save. Save your test data once in
settings, variables and encrypted

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:35.090
credentials.

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:43.610
Then, edit any generated step.

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:47.170
Here, the login steps use the
saved username and password.

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:04.390
Where tests appear on the Tests tab, each
step uses elements from your captured

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:04.870
screens.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.920
Drive the device with
hardware keys and text input.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:19.340
Record screens automatically, or
edit tests with the AI Assistant.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:24.720
Export tests as WebDriver
IOS specs for your CI.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:28.960
Build setup flows, hooks, and
your own reusable methods.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:35.850
Keep variables, credentials, and
your AI provider in settings.

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:39.150
That's WaveQA, Capture, Generate, Run.
